    "Upon successful completion of the program, the student will be able to speak, applying appropriate grammatical forms as well as vocabulary appropriate to the level of those students who are seeking an AA degree in Japanese.",
    "Upon successful completion of the program, the student will be able to examine spoken Japanese as evident in response through prepared dialogues and presentations as well as impromptu conversations with other students and the professor.",
    "Upon successful completion of the program, the student will be able to construct and apply appropriate grammatical forms as well as culturally appropriate vocabulary in writing in a mixture of Hiragana, Katakana, and Kanji characters at the level of those students who are seeking an AA degree in Japanese.",
    "Upon successful completion of the program, the student will be able to critique reading comprehension of informal and formal written texts in a mixture of Hiragana, Katakana, and Kanji characters, including informal letters or short essays as well as short news articles from Japan.",
